3. LICENSE KEYS AND DEVICE ACTIVATION

   (a) License Keys are issued free of charge from a verified KVRNL account.
   (b) A License Key binds to the first Device on which it is activated. Use of
       that key on a different Device will be refused.
   (b) You may move the Software to another Device by releasing the key from its
       current Device using the "Release device" control on your KVRNL account
       page, then activating it on the new Device.
   (d) The Software contacts KVRNL over HTTPS to validate your License Key.
       Section 8 describes exactly what is transmitted.
   (e) License Keys are issued to you personally. Sharing, selling, publishing,
       or transferring a License Key is prohibited and voids it.


